          ],
          "content": "the work done when the distance travelled is 2 units? Verify it by plotting it on the graph."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.148,
            0.885,
            0.19
          ],
          "content": "\\*10. The graph of a linear polynomial p(x) passes through the points (1, 5) and (3, 11)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.195,
            0.514,
            0.217
          ],
          "content": "(i) Find the polynomial p(x)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.185,
            0.22,
            0.872,
            0.243
          ],
          "content": "(ii) Find the coordinates where the graph of p(x) cuts the axes."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.247,
            0.762,
            0.269
          ],
          "content": "(iii) Draw the graph of p(x) and verify your answers."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.276,
            0.884,
            0.317
          ],
          "content": "\\*11. Let p(x) = ax + b and $q(x) = cx + d$ be two linear polynomials such that:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.194,
            0.322,
            0.329,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": "(i) p(0) = 5."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.185,
            0.349,
            0.772,
            0.371
          ],
          "content": "(ii) The polynomial p(x) – q(x) cuts the x-axis at (3, 0)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.375,
            0.775,
            0.397
          ],
          "content": "(iii) The sum p(x) + q(x) is equal to 6x + 4 for all real x."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.404,
            0.564,
            0.427
          ],
          "content": "Find the polynomials p(x) and q(x)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.434,
            0.886,
            0.517
          ],
